{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_05c05b4bedad0c143adad02e640e6452966319f73b93b6f6d9ea0a6effba7739","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e2ab0d3c1e4921bdaeab55625fa71d5cb75a76dba8871a278c19a47542b3d455"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"Telemetry is a limited anonymous daemon_active ping to PostHog at startup and every 24 hours, excluding session, project, prompt, file path, account, or machine identity, and can be disabled via environment variables.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_099faebbe18e45737952f8e7a174d17fcc457581cc224c4fb942fa2932601407","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63714a715b22c43ba76a0bb387f357b6d4db73ab10dcf91d889351756efa6c24","slc_f4e6e198843d0da21a5e889b0e46cbc19baa5dd0c241950614962de19a8f8983"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"The CLI offers serve, daemon (start/status/restart/stop), session list, and usage daily subcommands; on first run it discovers sessions, syncs them into local SQLite, and serves a web UI at http://127.0.0.1:8080.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_29356ed5e49796a2076775b733278f93cef66b6fd06a3424fd7a8e24710ffb19","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_764379d412df3d5d2f577bf27968cfda89c445db5e21b595fcd4b7057db0780e","slc_782d0c240858679753f11d2ca6625462c06dfcc9677e4b06fea792bb4f9333d9","slc_d562e8f16996c07adb21ec2143d440563b44be51b8f2d51f76ae3fb1ee378c25"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"The server binds to loopback by default and validates the request Host header to guard against DNS-rebinding; forwarded access needs --public-url, and exposure beyond loopback should enable --require-auth.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3686de3a820e69c33aa043f1c1580406b363f125289c331cd94f8a09a6625f29","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d3e946e2126c379e3417c06dc0fcef5ae4599f0aa71ef1711f46117bff44f8e1","slc_f87c986cbc3e9b1fdc736e624d80b257f2eea8ce0d1bcba651d47f5ab5a182f8"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"Aider is opt-in because it has no central session directory, Amp support is deprecated since current Amp releases may store threads server-side, and JetBrains Copilot requires an external exporter tool.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4d17d6f78b46a3de9f5bd69a9b6949bf0288e6e9707cd3816721f4985ff17c7d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_432f99e330e8f01134572030df1aa852d2dc3357b0ef892801620359e4f1bd70"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"Repository development practice: make bench-backends requires Docker and testcontainers to benchmark SQLite, DuckDB, and PostgreSQL store reads on a default fixture of 1,000 sessions and 64,000 messages, scalable via BENCH_BACKENDS_* env vars.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_640dd262d68ca7da7aa53ab7bccdbe923d4f7be5dbf33c1a8b9f5c8cf6f9201d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a9fc000b20647cf4293ce8bb09510c2de0b8c202dbd101f2c5266297f66104bb"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"The project layout includes a cmd/agentsview CLI entrypoint, internal Go packages (config, db, parser, server, sync, postgres), a Svelte 5 SPA frontend, and a Tauri desktop wrapper.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6ce2f92e4a3970e44b739456383b225f4252b2dfa59c3eeaba44289e6b6faf5c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ba568a790bacd17ae3f589b19d0f564623fa69486e1424098db102692b809ae7"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"DuckDB search currently falls back to substring/regex behavior; SQLite FTS5 remains the indexed search path for primary local serving.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_86463de79669ddfbde84cc02ed0c760a395d2d0254da8e8aa39017ee0baf0313","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_25b6998988a1576cad925d6b5e4f5a48c274343e18ac153f255995bd5addb6b8","slc_f43f0dd56ad403e7b55c509a88d01ed4bfd98bfce4554a6533e3a7097a45d4dc"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"A REST endpoint GET /api/v1/sessions/{id}/usage returns fields such as total_output_tokens, peak_context_tokens, and cost as an integer microdollar object; existing sessions return 200 and missing ones 404.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_87ca86287f73e1f716674024cb7222c856290d65af2b6b057b75ebd5c487d6a7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_483a98a9d5396140a2784e5f576a0780660fa589b7f10fc8e3981030656654fb","slc_7a39b2daaefdf1132d4f6595e22795299026365d3fcda12aa23def1da2693eff","slc_90b09df7cbd56b8899b60a8d5bfa2efdec68c5a6e6c765a9a6286b755cdbedb6","slc_922b0e332e1a73d832029564b4db4ee02b37475d640b2cee5bad76db226d231e","slc_f87c986cbc3e9b1fdc736e624d80b257f2eea8ce0d1bcba651d47f5ab5a182f8"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"The tool discovers sessions from multiple coding agents including Aider, Amp, Antigravity, Goose, Grok, and Copilot, with per-agent session directories and env-var overrides such as AIDER_DIR, GROK_DIR, and GOOSE_PATH_ROOT.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ac32f679f03cc9b3ebad6b87ae22d66db2d45e22010111893e5118c04fa4b158","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fe2b9109cfcae39ece282679a64dda03abd0e9ab11b6bd967ee886b64d4e498c"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"Quack serving uses conservative defaults: local serving binds to loopback, requires a token, and rejects non-loopback plain HTTP unless --allow-insecure is explicitly passed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b6225177e28586c668ee0b049c5331280f1227a75a42b64c5770a1e4f3942b5d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d68dcd55e9f475b5b5115a486549702a1dbba6d72399b80d7bfc613aae7d5b32"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"Building the project requires Go 1.27+ with CGO and Node.js 24.11+.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cc052e76cf6eb1774c899bf8742a6e32424828218569cd07bf4b73073bca894e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fea4aa3fb698d80ecc031a201c2858a8a33a2643ab1e708bfff334364fa2cd06"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"SQLite is the primary local archive with FTS5 search and a writable UI; PostgreSQL is an optional shared team backend served read-only, and DuckDB is an optional mirror file or Quack endpoint served read-only.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cd048aa49803752ea4798a064394a5344b8920fc5b061cbcd645020261c5a54f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2f7e1c414ef599eab3db6e94c6fe7cc0d971a7627541d3201e2584868a0aeadd","slc_55314502040b103ad83a0687aaa08aeb4d8cee80cb0042cf712410f67a5cfb9b"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"The daemon is a single process hosting the web UI, API, session sync, and file watchers; background daemons self-exit after an idle period unless a client request or daemon-owned job is active.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d844ae94cca37cc6718e46b5afebbea603f0229efaf0444f880a8b6b4831ce80","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44db6b319c3180c3925e3c3ba40a3b73548d90f49fa4fc572ec2de7247c58cb7"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"Cost calculation uses LiteLLM and OpenRouter pricing rates with an offline fallback, and reports authoritative Copilot CLI billing totals when session logs provide them.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_de37c7dc35293f2a170cfaedfe106a6cbf20d59fb93e29745ca25a8172105080","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"kenn-io/agentsview@d61382967490 snapshot 854bb9d72f0e0765","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_45596471c6c634def91a22cba9d9c6cae30b604d7699f51723c2b21dc8ebc5c2","slc_48b9c0b54b9f50c5a60d8a0b4c8804dc582262cfc21833d0db13bc4161b86a6d","slc_9da4b24cca74ea0cbed361b3ceb4d3f3f85200cae7200359384d19b54201b14c"],"source_ids":["src_cf70a40a4c61502c9cd2a2c0a0015f4c"],"text":"Repository development practice: building and testing use make targets (make dev, make build, make test with CGO and fts5 tags, make lint, make e2e for Playwright), with prek-based pre-commit hooks installed via make lint-tools and make install-hooks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_aec0a79cb18d458399ccc1e0a9bd746f"}
